// Dialog :
"P2348618256" "Shame about old Malachai. He wasn't much to look at, but he was smart and he was tricky. I can't say I'll shed many tears over him, but I'll still do my best to avenge him. We can't let anyone go around taking out Arachnos agents. Not people, and not ghosts."
// RandomFameString :
"P4107886200" "{VillainName} fought off the Red Hands and the Legacy Chain!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - RANDOM_FEMALE_BUSINESS 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3618322131" "So, I was right. Phantom Phil killed Malachai, and somehow he's stupid enough to think he's going to get away with it. Well, Arachnos won't let that happen. We can't do much to Phil himself -- dead, you know -- but we can still bring some serious pressure to bear. You see, Phil's a recent addition to the ghostly population, and his mom's still alive. I want you to get over to her office and kidnap her. Then we'll see what Phil has to say about his little misadventure."
// AcceptString :
"P3402638038" "Kidnap Phil's mother"
// SendOffString :
"P390626913" "Let this be a lesson to you, {VillainName}. Cross Arachnos at your own peril -- and that of the ones you love."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3564159384" "Phil's mum is still among the free. Can't have that, can we, {VillainName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1023356010" "You hear a voice cry out, 'Gentlemen and ladies, the Legacy Chain is here to protect you!'"

